1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Heated seats stopped working?
It's not always the switch.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
One side warms, the other stays
cold — or neither side does.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Three clues, in order: the fuse,
the switch, the heating element.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
A blown fuse can point to a bigger
short — one that can keep coming back.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess which one it is before
you start pulling seats apart.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before winter gets here.
Stop by — Nick's Tire & Auto.
